constraints:
1 <= N <= 10^{5}
1 <= Entry[i],Exit[i] <= 10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(N*Log(N) ).
expected auxiliary space: O(1).

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def findMaxGuests(self, Entry, Exit, N):
		ans = 0
		count = 0
		data = []
		time = 0
		for i in range(N):
			data.append([Entry[i], 'x'])
			data.append([Exit[i], 'y'])
		data = sorted(data)
		for i in range(len(data)):
			if data[i][1] == 'x':
				count += 1
			if data[i][1] == 'y':
				count -= 1
			if ans < count:
				ans = count
				time = data[i][0]
		return (ans, time)
